message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "SnaCleX: a browser-based structural biology workbench for protein–ligand interaction analysis"
abstract: >-
  Browser based structural biology workbench for protein and ligand interaction
  analysis, pocket detection and ranking, evolutionary conservation scoring, and
  exploratory docking from RCSB PDB structures, with method provenance on every result.
authors:
